{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 5000}, "text": " Hi, welcome to the EEVblog, an electronics engineering video blog"}, {"offsets": {"from": 5000, "to": 8000}, "text": " of interest to anyone involved in electronics design."}, {"offsets": {"from": 8000, "to": 10000}, "text": " I'm your host, Dave Jones."}, {"offsets": {"from": 10000, "to": 14000}, "text": " Hi, it turns out that I'm running out of room in the EEVblog lab."}, {"offsets": {"from": 14000, "to": 19000}, "text": " Go figure, it's only about 2.5 metres by 2.5 metres, it's not very big at all."}, {"offsets": {"from": 19000, "to": 23000}, "text": " So here I am in the study, which is the only other room I've got available,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 23000, "to": 27000}, "text": " and I've got my junk cupboard here, but it's not very well organised."}, {"offsets": {"from": 27000, "to": 31000}, "text": " Let's check it out. Look at this. It's basically my book."}, {"offsets": {"from": 31000, "to": 36000}, "text": " It's got a very old, you know, a 20, almost 30-year-old bookshelf."}, {"offsets": {"from": 36000, "to": 41000}, "text": " It's got some crap drawers here with cables. It's got boxes stuffed up the top."}, {"offsets": {"from": 41000, "to": 46000}, "text": " And basically I need more room for all of my component boxes and things like that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 46000, "to": 51000}, "text": " and my plastic tubs for all the gear. I use these in the EEVblog lab."}, {"offsets": {"from": 51000, "to": 53000}, "text": " I've shown you a tour of that before."}, {"offsets": {"from": 53000, "to": 58000}, "text": " So I thought what I'd do is rip all this out and fit some shelves in here"}, {"offsets": {"from": 58000, "to": 61000}, "text": " that are the perfect size for these plastic tubs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 61000, "to": 67000}, "text": " So the whole idea is to refit it so I can actually get rid of a lot of these books,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 67000, "to": 71000}, "text": " probably not get rid of them, just put them into storage up in the roof or something like that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 71000, "to": 77000}, "text": " and refit out all this so I can neatly organise stuff so I can access it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77000, "to": 80000}, "text": " So I thought I'd show you building this thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 113000, "to": 116000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 130000, "to": 133000}, "text": " Stud finder. Let's give it a go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 136000, "to": 138000}, "text": " Beauty."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138000, "to": 141000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 146000}, "text": " BUDGET"}, {"offsets": {"from": 146000, "to": 149000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 149000, "to": 152000}, "text": " BUDGET"}, {"offsets": {"from": 152000, "to": 155000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 158000}, "text": " BUDGET"}, {"offsets": {"from": 158000, "to": 161000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 161000, "to": 164000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 164000, "to": 167000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 167000, "to": 170000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 174000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 174000, "to": 177000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 177000, "to": 180000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 180000, "to": 183000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 183000, "to": 186000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 186000, "to": 189000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 189000, "to": 192000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 192000, "to": 195000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 195000, "to": 198000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 198000, "to": 201000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 204000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 204000, "to": 207000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 207000, "to": 210000}, "text": " MUSIC"}, {"offsets": 